`_materialise_framework_only_branch(path: Path) -> None` (preserves
the fail-soft semantics: non-zero exit ignored, downstream checkout
diagnoses absence precisely). The helper is called from BOTH
`_resolve_url_to_clone_source` (replacing the existing inline block)
AND from `bootstrap_new_workspace`'s local-path branch (after the
`local_path` validation, before passing it to `_clone_canonical`).
URL-form behaviour is byte-identical post-refactor; the local-path
branch gains the materialisation step that was missing pre-FBE.10.

`framework/workspace-bootstrap/tests/test_AC_FBE_10_1_local_path_clone_of_canonical.py`
