canonical, clones it into a "stranger-clone" path (so `framework-only`
exists ONLY as a remote-tracking ref on the clone), and asserts
`bootstrap_new_workspace` succeeds with the resulting workspace's
framework subdir checked out on `framework-only`. The test is RED
